---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Dental Blog"
description: "Patient-first dental education from 3rd Set Smiles in Tempe, AZ. Implant, extraction, and urgent-care topics written for real patient decisions."
permalink: /blog/
breadcrumb:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Blog", url: "/blog/" }
---

<section class="page-hero blog-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span>Blog</div>
    <h1>Dental Blog: Real Questions, Clear Answers</h1>
    <p class="lede">Educational guidance for patients in Tempe, Mesa, and nearby East Valley communities. Clinical content is reviewed by Dr. Phillips before publication.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="blog-grid">
      {% for post in collections.blog %}
      {% set category = blogCategories | findCategory(post.data.blogCategory) %}
      <article class="blog-card">
        <p class="blog-card-kicker">{{ category.label if category else post.data.blogCategory }}</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <p class="blog-card-meta">Published {{ post.date | humanDate }}{% if post.data.dateUpdated %} &middot; Updated {{ post.data.dateUpdated | humanDate }}{% endif %}</p>
        <p><a href="{{ post.url }}">Read article →</a></p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-in" style="margin-bottom:24px">
      <div class="section-label">Editorial Roadmap</div>
      <h2 style="color:var(--navy)">Planned Patient Questions</h2>
      <p class="muted">Topics are prioritized by patient urgency and decision impact. Every clinical article requires Dr. Phillips' review before publication.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roadmap-table-wrap">
      <table class="roadmap-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Topic</th>
            <th scope="col">Priority</th>
            <th scope="col">Status</th>
            <th scope="col">Patient question</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for item in blogRoadmap %}
          <tr>
            <td>
              {% if item.stage == "Drafted" %}
              <a href="/blog/{{ item.slug }}/">{{ item.title }}</a>
              {% else %}
              {{ item.title }}
              {% endif %}
            </td>
            <td>{{ item.priority }}</td>
            <td>{{ item.stage }}</td>
            <td>{{ item.patientQuestion }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
